  "description": "Advanced logging library with Serilog integration. Provides enterprise-grade\n      logging capabilities with support for multiple sinks (console, file, database, Elasticsearch),\n      structured logging, custom enrichers, and cloud-native observability patterns. Features\n      official ELK stack integration with Elastic.Serilog.Sinks, ECS compliance, and\n      high-performance logging for .NET applications.",
