  "releaseNotes": "Enhanced with official Elastic.Serilog.Sinks integration for ELK stack\n      support, ECS compliance, and data streams. Removed S3 dependencies for simplified\n      architecture. Added enterprise-grade logging capabilities with structured logging, custom\n      enrichers, and cloud-native observability patterns. Optimized for high-performance production\n      workloads.",
